---@field displayName? string Output only. Display name of the tool.
---@field tool? string Optional. The name of the tool to execute. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/apps/{app}/tools/{tool}`
---@field id? string Optional. The unique identifier of the tool call. If populated, the client should return the execution result with the matching ID in ToolResponse.
---@field agentName? string Output only. Human-readable name of the agent that issued this call, e.g. "Contract Architect". Empty when the root agent issued it.

---The execution result of a specific tool from the client or the agent.
