---The CCAI Insights project wide analysis rule. This rule will be applied to all conversations that match the filter defined in the rule. For a conversation matches the filter, the annotators specified in the rule will be run. If a conversation matches multiple rules, a union of all the annotators will be run. One project can have multiple analysis rules.
---@class gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1AnalysisRule
---@field name? string Identifier. The resource name of the analysis rule. Format: projects/{project}/locations/{location}/analysisRules/{analysis_rule}
---@field createTime? string Output only. The time at which this analysis rule was created.
---@field analysisPercentage? number Percentage of conversations that we should apply this analysis setting automatically, between [0, 1]. For example, 0.1 means 10%. Conversations are sampled in a determenestic way. The original runtime_percentage & upload percentage will be replaced by defining filters on the conversation.
---@field active? boolean If true, apply this rule to conversations. Otherwise, this rule is inactive and saved as a draft.
---@field satisfiesPzi? boolean Output only. Whether this resource is zone isolated.
---@field satisfiesPzs? boolean Output only. Whether this resource is zone separated.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The most recent time at which this analysis rule was updated.
---@field annotatorSelector? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1AnnotatorSelector Selector of annotators to run and the phrase matchers to use for conversations that matches the conversation_filter. If not specified, NO annotators will be run.
---@field displayName? string Display Name of the analysis rule.
---@field conversationFilter? string Filter for the conversations that should apply this analysis rule. An empty filter means this analysis rule applies to all conversations. Refer to https://cloud.google.com/contact-center/insights/docs/filtering for details.

---@alias gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1AnalysisRuleList gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1AnalysisRule[]

