---@class gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1AnnotatorSelector
---@field runInterruptionAnnotator? boolean Whether to run the interruption annotator.
---@field runEntityAnnotator? boolean Whether to run the entity annotator.
