---The conversation resource.
---@class gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1Conversation
---@field expireTime? string The time at which this conversation should expire. After this time, the conversation data and any associated analyses will be deleted.
---@field ttl? string Input only. The TTL for this resource. If specified, then this TTL will be used to calculate the expire time.
---@field callMetadata? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1ConversationCallMetadata Call-specific metadata.
---@field dataSource? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1ConversationDataSource The source of the audio and transcription for the conversation.
---@field name? string Immutable. The resource name of the conversation. Format: projects/{project}/locations/{location}/conversations/{conversation}
---@field languageCode? string A user-specified language code for the conversation.
---@field correlationInfo? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1ConversationCorrelationInfo Output only. Info for correlating across conversations.
---@field metadataJson? string Optional. JSON metadata encoded as a string. This field is primarily used by Insights integrations with various telephony systems and must be in one of Insight's supported formats.
---@field labels? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.StringMap A map for the user to specify any custom fields. A maximum of 100 labels per conversation is allowed, with a maximum of 256 characters per entry.
---@field satisfiesPzs? boolean Output only. Whether this resource is zone separated.
---@field dialogflowIntents? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1DialogflowIntentMap Output only. All the matched Dialogflow intents in the call. The key corresponds to a Dialogflow intent, format: projects/{project}/agent/{agent}/intents/{intent}
---@field createTime? string Output only. The time at which the conversation was created.
---@field runtimeAnnotations? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1RuntimeAnnotationList Output only. The annotations that were generated during the customer and agent interaction.
---@field latestAnalysis? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1Analysis Output only. The conversation's latest analysis, if one exists.
---@field obfuscatedUserId? string Obfuscated user ID which the customer sent to us.
---@field latestSummary? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1ConversationSummarizationSuggestionData Output only. Latest summary of the conversation.
---@field satisfiesPzi? boolean Output only. Whether this resource is zone isolated.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The most recent time at which the conversation was updated.
---@field transcript? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1ConversationTranscript Output only. The conversation transcript.
---@field medium? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1ConversationMediumEnum|string Immutable. The conversation medium.
---@field startTime? string The time at which the conversation started.
---@field qualityMetadata? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1ConversationQualityMetadata Conversation metadata related to quality management.
---@field duration? string Output only. The duration of the conversation.
---@field agentId? string An opaque, user-specified string representing the human agent who handled the conversation.
---@field turnCount? number Output only. The number of turns in the conversation.

