---The phrase matcher resource.
---@class gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1PhraseMatcher
---@field displayName? string The human-readable name of the phrase matcher.
---@field active? boolean Applies the phrase matcher only when it is active.
---@field versionTag? string The customized version tag to use for the phrase matcher. If not specified, it will default to `revision_id`.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The most recent time at which the phrase matcher was updated.
---@field type? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1PhraseMatcherTypeEnum Required. The type of this phrase matcher.
---@field roleMatch? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1PhraseMatcherRoleMatchEnum The role whose utterances the phrase matcher should be matched against. If the role is ROLE_UNSPECIFIED it will be matched against any utterances in the transcript.
---@field revisionCreateTime? string Output only. The timestamp of when the revision was created. It is also the create time when a new matcher is added.
---@field revisionId? string Output only. Immutable. The revision ID of the phrase matcher. A new revision is committed whenever the matcher is changed, except when it is activated or deactivated. A server generated random ID will be used. Example: locations/global/phraseMatchers/my-first-matcher@1234567
---@field name? string The resource name of the phrase matcher. Format: projects/{project}/locations/{location}/phraseMatchers/{phrase_matcher}
---@field activationUpdateTime? string Output only. The most recent time at which the activation status was updated.
---@field phraseMatchRuleGroups? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1PhraseMatchRuleGroupList A list of phase match rule groups that are included in this matcher.

---@alias gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1PhraseMatcherList gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1PhraseMatcher[]

---@alias gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1PhraseMatcherRoleMatchEnum "ROLE_UNSPECIFIED"|"HUMAN_AGENT"|"AUTOMATED_AGENT"|"END_USER"|"ANY_AGENT"

---@alias gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1PhraseMatcherTypeEnum "PHRASE_MATCHER_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"ALL_OF"|"ANY_OF"

---The message to publish an assessment. Draft and appealed assessments can be published. Publishing simply changes the state of the assessment to published, allowing the console and authorized views to filter on the state.
