---An answer to a QaQuestion.
---@class gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaAnswer
---@field questionBody? string Question text. E.g., "Did the agent greet the customer?"
---@field answerValue? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaAnswerAnswerValue The answer value from this source. This field is populated by default, unless the question has a selection strategy configured to return multiple answer values, in which case `answer_values` will be populated instead.
---@field qaQuestion? string The QaQuestion answered by this answer.
---@field answerSources? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaAnswerAnswerSourceList Lists all answer sources containing one or more answer values of a specific source type, e.g., all system-generated answer sources, or all manual edit answer sources.
---@field tags? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.StringList User-defined list of arbitrary tags. Matches the value from QaScorecard.ScorecardQuestion.tags. Used for grouping/organization and for weighting the score of each answer.
---@field conversation? string The conversation the answer applies to.

---A question may have multiple answers from varying sources, one of which becomes the "main" answer above. AnswerSource represents each individual answer.
---@class gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaAnswerAnswerSource
---@field answerValue? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaAnswerAnswerValue The answer value from this source. This field is populated by default, unless the question has a selection strategy configured to return multiple answer values, in which case `answer_values` will be populated instead.
---@field sourceType? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaAnswerAnswerSourceSourceTypeEnum|string What created the answer.

---@alias gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaAnswerAnswerSourceList gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaAnswerAnswerSource[]

---@alias gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaAnswerAnswerSourceSourceTypeEnum "SOURCE_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"SYSTEM_GENERATED"|"MANUAL_EDIT"

---Message for holding the value of a QaAnswer. QaQuestion.AnswerChoice defines the possible answer values for a question.
---@class gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaAnswerAnswerValue
---@field naValue? boolean A value of "Not Applicable (N/A)". Should only ever be `true`.
---@field key? string A short string used as an identifier. Matches the value used in QaQuestion.AnswerChoice.key.
---@field potentialScore? number Output only. The maximum potential score of the question.
---@field strValue? string String value.
---@field numValue? number Numerical value.
---@field boolValue? boolean Boolean value.
---@field skipValue? boolean Output only. A value of "Skip". If provided, this field may only be set to `true`. If a question receives this answer, it will be excluded from any score calculations. This would mean that the question was not evaluated.
---@field normalizedScore? number Output only. Normalized score of the questions. Calculated as score / potential_score.
---@field score? number Output only. Numerical score of the answer.

---@alias gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaAnswerList gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaAnswer[]

---A single question to be scored by the Insights QA feature.
---@class gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestion
---@field answerChoices? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionAnswerChoiceList A list of valid answers to the question, which the LLM must choose from.
---@field answerInstructions? string Instructions describing how to determine the answer.
---@field satisfiesPzi? boolean Output only. Whether this resource is zone isolated.
---@field predefinedQuestionConfig? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionPredefinedQuestionConfig The configuration of the predefined question. This field will only be set if the Question Type is predefined.
---@field name? string Identifier. The resource name of the question. Format: projects/{project}/locations/{location}/qaScorecards/{qa_scorecard}/revisions/{revision}/qaQuestions/{qa_question}
---@field metrics? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionMetrics Metrics of the underlying tuned LLM over a holdout/test set while fine tuning the underlying LLM for the given question. This field will only be populated if and only if the question is part of a scorecard revision that has been tuned.
---@field tags? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.StringList Questions are tagged for categorization and scoring. Tags can either be: - Default Tags: These are predefined categories. They are identified by their string value (e.g., "BUSINESS", "COMPLIANCE", and "CUSTOMER"). - Custom Tags: These are user-defined categories. They are identified by their full resource name (e.g., projects/{project}/locations/{location}/qaQuestionTags/{qa_question_tag}). Both default and custom tags are used to group questions and to influence the scoring of each question.
---@field questionBody? string Question text. E.g., "Did the agent greet the customer?"
---@field order? number Defines the order of the question within its parent scorecard revision.
---@field satisfiesPzs? boolean Output only. Whether this resource is zone separated.
---@field createTime? string Output only. The time at which this question was created.
---@field tuningMetadata? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionTuningMetadata Metadata about the tuning operation for the question.This field will only be populated if and only if the question is part of a scorecard revision that has been tuned.
---@field qaQuestionDataOptions? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionQaQuestionDataOptions Options for configuring the data used to generate the QA question.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The most recent time at which the question was updated.
---@field questionType? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionQuestionTypeEnum The type of question.
---@field abbreviation? string Short, descriptive string, used in the UI where it's not practical to display the full question body. E.g., "Greeting".

---Message representing a possible answer to the question.
---@class gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionAnswerChoice
---@field numValue? number Numerical value.
---@field key? string A short string used as an identifier.
---@field boolValue? boolean Boolean value.
---@field strValue? string String value.
---@field score? number Numerical score of the answer, used for generating the overall score of a QaScorecardResult. If the answer uses na_value, this field is unused.
---@field naValue? boolean A value of "Not Applicable (N/A)". If provided, this field may only be set to `true`. If a question receives this answer, it will be excluded from any score calculations.

---@alias gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionAnswerChoiceList gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionAnswerChoice[]

---@alias gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionList gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestion[]

---A wrapper representing metrics calculated against a test-set on a LLM that was fine tuned for this question.
---@class gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionMetrics
---@field accuracy? number Output only. Accuracy of the model. Measures the percentage of correct answers the model gave on the test set.

---Configuration for a predefined question. This field will only be set if the Question Type is predefined.
---@class gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionPredefinedQuestionConfig
---@field type? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionPredefinedQuestionConfigTypeEnum|string The type of the predefined question.

---@alias gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionPredefinedQuestionConfigTypeEnum "PREDEFINED_QUESTION_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"CONVERSATION_OUTCOME"|"CONVERSATION_OUTCOME_ESCALATION_INITIATOR_ROLE"|"CONVERSATION_OUTCOME_AI_AVERSION"|"CONVERSATION_OUTCOME_ESCALATION_REASON"

---Options for configuring the data used to generate the QA question.
---@class gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionQaQuestionDataOptions
---@field conversationDataOptions? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1ConversationDataOptions Options for configuring the conversation data used to generate the QA question.

---@alias gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionQuestionTypeEnum "QA_QUESTION_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"CUSTOMIZABLE"|"PREDEFINED"

---A tag is a resource which aims to categorize a set of questions across multiple scorecards, e.g., "Customer Satisfaction","Billing", etc.
---@class gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionTag
---@field name? string Identifier. Resource name for the QaQuestionTag Format projects/{project}/locations/{location}/qaQuestionTags/{qa_question_tag} In the above format, the last segment, i.e., qa_question_tag, is a server-generated ID corresponding to the tag resource.
---@field qaQuestionIds? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.StringList Optional. The list of Scorecard Question IDs that the tag applies to. Each QaQuestionId is represented as a full resource name containing the Question ID. Lastly, Since a tag may not necessarily be referenced by any Scorecard Questions, we treat this field as optional.
---@field displayName? string Required. A user-specified display name for the tag.
---@field satisfiesPzs? boolean Output only. Whether this resource is zone separated.
---@field satisfiesPzi? boolean Output only. Whether this resource is zone isolated.
---@field createTime? string Output only. The time at which the question tag was created.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The most recent time at which the question tag was updated.

---@alias gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionTagList gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionTag[]

---Metadata about the tuning operation for the question. Will only be set if a scorecard containing this question has been tuned.
---@class gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionTuningMetadata
---@field datasetValidationWarnings? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionTuningMetadataDatasetValidationWarningsItemEnumList A list of any applicable data validation warnings about the question's feedback labels.
---@field totalValidLabelCount? string Total number of valid labels provided for the question at the time of tuining.
---@field tuningError? string Error status of the tuning operation for the question. Will only be set if the tuning operation failed.

---@alias gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaQuestionTuningMetadataDatasetValidationWarningsItemEnum "DATASET_VALIDATION_WARNING_UNSPECIFIED"|"TOO_MANY_INVALID_FEEDBACK_LABELS"|"INSUFFICIENT_FEEDBACK_LABELS"|"INSUFFICIENT_FEEDBACK_LABELS_PER_ANSWER"|"ALL_FEEDBACK_LABELS_HAVE_THE_SAME_ANSWER"

