---@field qaAnswers? gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaAnswerList Set of QaAnswers represented in the result.
---@field createTime? string Output only. The timestamp that the revision was created.
---@field qaScorecardRevision? string The QaScorecardRevision scored by this result.

---@alias gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaScorecardResultList gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1QaScorecardResult[]

