---Message for sampling conversations.
---@class gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1SampleRule
---@field samplePercentage? number Percentage of conversations that we should sample based on the dimension between [0, 100].
---@field sampleRow? string Number of the conversations that we should sample based on the dimension.
---@field dimension? string Optional. Group by dimension to sample the conversation. If no dimension is provided, the sampling will be applied to the project level. Current supported dimensions is 'quality_metadata.agent_info.agent_id'.
---@field conversationFilter? string To specify the filter for the conversions that should apply this sample rule. An empty filter means this sample rule applies to all conversations.

---Message for schedule info.
---@class gcp.contactcenterinsights_v1.GoogleCloudContactcenterinsightsV1ScheduleInfo
---@field endTime? string End time of the schedule. If not specified, will keep scheduling new pipelines for execution util the schedule is no longer active or deleted.
---@field startTime? string Start time of the schedule. If not specified, will start as soon as the schedule is created.
---@field schedule? string The groc expression. Format: `every number [synchronized]` Time units can be: minutes, hours Synchronized is optional and indicates that the schedule should be synchronized to the start of the interval: every 5 minutes synchronized means 00:00, 00:05 ... Otherwise the start time is random within the interval. Example: `every 5 minutes` could be 00:02, 00:07, 00:12, ...
---@field timeZone? string The timezone to use for the groc expression. If not specified, defaults to UTC.

